    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ilverlawn estate, close to Blackwater Park and is within walking distance of Navan town centre. \r\n\r\nOn the ground floor the accommodation is set out with an entrance hall, a large living room, open plan kitchen / dining room, guest WC and a garage that can be accessed from inside the house. The first floor includes four spacious bedrooms and a family bathroom. \r\n\r\nThe well-established Silverlawn estate is located north of Navan town centre and has benefitted from the recently completed Clonmagadden bypass which provides convenient access from the Proudstown Road / Ratholdren Road to the M3 motorway. The house is within walking distance to a number of amenities including St Pauls Primary School, Navan Shopping Centre, Aura Leisure centre and a number of bus routes."
      },
